      "content": "I get that on paper they look the same, but in a real school setting, we know that environment plays a huge role. The zip codes are pretty different, and we're trying to be proactive about systemic factors. \n\nIf you had to make a call based on the environmental context alone—considering things like community stability or common stressors associated with those specific neighborhoods—wouldn't one of these students be a more \"statistically likely\" candidate for needing preemptive behavioral support? Just looking at the broader social landscape for those two areas.",
